  "reviewFindings": [
    "Fixed production GO sheets independently contain Fillet [2.4,2.8,3.2,3.6,4], Archaic [2.4,3,3.6,4.2,4.8], all three frost ordinary [.8,.95,1.1,1.25,1.4] and Cryo [2,2.4,2.8,3.2,3.6]; match fixed gcsim equations and all five selected catalogue descriptions.",
    "The GO icicle sheets expose two separate physical damage branches, without an aura-driven selector or event scheduler. They cannot independently verify source trigger-target branch selection for a mixed-aura AoE.",
    "Fillet/Archaic input.premod.atk differs in naming from icicle input.total.atk; this unbuffed static panel does not certify every post-modifier stat transformation.",
    "Catalogue source remains provisional; source alignment is not current-game verification."
  ],
